-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Sep 28 18:31:01 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 1.0
  Tweaks:
  * Application icon added.
  * Radio button added to select which side(s) the side panels are
    on.
  * The radio button selects if either one or two number-of-columns
    spinbox(es) appears below. This should reduce the apparently
    unpredictable behaviour caused by both side panels always
    adding up to 16 columns but one side panel being any width.
  * State of "show hex values" checkbox in palette dockwindow is
    now saved.
  * DRCS definitions with bit 6 unset are now shown.
  Bug fixes:
  * Page view would not update immediately if side panel columns
    were changed.
  * Page view would sometimes not update if a page with side panels
    was loaded.
  * A page defining side panels on "both" sides with only a 16
    column right side panel would cause a spurious left side panel
    of 16 columns to appear.
  * Newly created Object Defition triplets were set to Level 2.5
    only.
  * Level 1.5 "different Active Position" warnings were never
    cleared.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Dec  2 12:53:20 UTC 2025 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 0.8.2
  Tweaks:
  * Added additional escape key sequences for inserting colour
    attributes using the top row of letters on the AZERTY keyboard
    layout.
  * Added "select all".
  * Better handling of corrupted X/26 enhancement triplets in
    t42 files.  Triplets that have failed Hamming decoding are now
    explicitly shown as such in the X/26 enhancement list.
  Bug fixes:
  * A PNG image exported in Mix mode would not have transparency.
  * An animated GIF image exported in Mix mode had flashing text
    that would not flash to transparent.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Oct 26 16:03:31 UTC 2025 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 0.8.1
  Bug fixes:
  * Some window/dockwindow layouts would cause the central page
    editing widget to get "lost" or severely shrunk into the
    corner of the window on the next startup. 30bff43
  * Deeper zoom settings were not applied correctly on the next
    startup. 07abbdf
  Tweak:
  * A new option to clear the list of most recently opened files.
  Build tweak:
  * Ensure the decoder and the GIF writer are built in.
- Update to version 0.8.0
  New features:
  * Support for rendering DRCS characters.
  * DRCS downloading pages with PTUs can be loaded into the editor
    using the "DRCS pages" submenu within the "View" menu.
    + Added a dockwindow for editing Level 3.5 DCLUTs.
    + An image of the shown subpage can be copied to the clipboard.
      This can be found as "Copy as image" in the "Edit" menu.
  Tweaks:
  * Improved rendering of G0 capital letters with diacritical
    marks.
  * The border around the page is the native GUI colour instead
    of blue.
  Bug fixes:
  * Exported images now have working transparency.
  * Exporting to the zxnet editor now includes the page region.
  Build changes for *nix:
  * .desktop file installed.
  * Don't put a spurious qt.conf in the bin directory.

